#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokemonHavePersonalities"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON has a NAIVE nature, and my\n"
"friend's has a JOLLY nature.\p"
"It's fascinating how POKéMON have\n"
"personalities!$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦是天真的性格，\n"
"我朋友的是爽朗的性格。\p"
"宝可梦也有各自的个性，\n"
"真是有意思！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MaleAndFemalePokemon"
msgid ""
"Just like people, there are male and\n"
"female POKéMON.\p"
"But no one seems to have any idea how\n"
"they're different.$"
msgstr ""
"和人类一样，\n"
"宝可梦也有雄性和雌性。\p"
"可是好像没有人知道\n"
"它们到底有什么不同。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:43
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HMCutNextDoor"
msgid ""
"The man next door gave me an HM!\p"
"I used it to teach my POKéMON how to\n"
"CUT down skinny trees.$"
msgstr ""
"隔壁的大叔给了我一个秘传学习器！\p"
"我用它教会了我的宝可梦\n"
"用居合斩砍断细小的树木。$"
